      "message": "This command was previously an unimplemented no-op on every platform. SantaBarbara\u0027s BIOS needs the switch board SKU to select the correct PCIe configuration at boot, so this adds the first real implementation for it. Other platforms still get an empty/success response, but the check now does a real entity-manager lookup before concluding it\u0027s not applicable, instead of an instant no-op like before",
